{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/AboutTheGame_1.png?t=1753217475\" /></div><strong>Have you ever yearned for an adventure 'cross the far seas........ with yer cats?</strong><br><br><br>Purrates is an adventurous point &amp; click mystery focused on the tale of a pirate cat crew.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/AboutTheGame_2.png?t=1753217475\" /></div><strong>Experience the epic tale of the Purrates crew on their valiant quest to discover the mystery of the Red Dot! </strong><br> <br><strong> </strong><br>  <br>Talk to the local residents - the harbor workers may know a few things about the island and where to find supplies.<strong> </strong>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/AboutTheGame_3.gif?t=1753217475\" /></div><strong>Explore the harbor, town square &amp; tavern while chatting with fellow purrates to learn more about this great mystery...... </strong> <br>  <br><strong> </strong> <br>  <br>Take your time to soak in the atmosphere and get immersed in the pirate setting!<strong> </strong>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/AboutTheGame_4.gif?t=1753217475\" /></div><strong>Immerse yerself in the cat-pirate world of Purrates!</strong>   <br><br>  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795950/extras/purrates.png?t=1753217475\" /></div><br><i>Comic book panel art by Jordan Deemi</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795950?t=1753217475","background_raw":"https://store